parsed_output.analysis:
The specification describes a simple 4-transition state machine: (1) InitialState -> BrakingState on brake signal received, (2) InitialState -> OperationalState if signal transmission fails, (3) return to InitialState once signal feedback is sent (from wherever this applies), and (4) BrakingState -> ClampingState upon entering braking state. The model introduces extra states and transitions not described in the spec, and the "return to initial state" logic is ambiguous/overextended compared to spec text.</analysis>
